# Export your feedback. Start the API with Aspire first, then send the first requests once.
@host = http://localhost:5279

### Create an account → 201. The requests below use its access token.
# @name createAccount
POST {{host}}/api/v1/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user-{{$guid}}@example.com",
  "password": "password",
  "timeZone": "Europe/Zagreb"
}

### Feedback → 201, with one screenshot.
POST {{host}}/api/v1/feedback
Authorization: Bearer {{createAccount.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "bug",
  "message": "The rest timer stops when the phone locks.",
  "screenshots": ["/9j/4A=="],
  "appVersion": "1.0.0",
  "phone": "Google Pixel 8",
  "os": "Android 15"
}

### The export → 200, every ticket with its messages and screenshots.
GET {{host}}/api/v1/feedback/export
Authorization: Bearer {{createAccount.response.body.$.accessToken}}
